      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "The hybrid X25519MLKEM768 key exchange defeats harvest-now-decrypt-later; the API's own server certificate stays classical ECDSA P-256 because Go's crypto/tls cannot parse ML-DSA certificates yet."
